## Phase 1 — Zoom (`BirdEyeZoomService`)

**Files**: `bird_eye_zoom_service.py`, `player_core_extension/extension.py`, `AppStream.tsx`

- Wheel events on `#remote-video` (accumulated + throttled) and two-finger pinch both dispatch `sendMessage('birdEyeZoomLevel', { delta })` while `env.currentCamera === 'bird_eye'`.
- `BirdEyeZoomService.on_zoom_delta()` mutates the active bird-eye camera's `focalLength` on the session layer (wipes on scene reload).
- `BirdEyeZoomService.snap_restore()` is called from `settings_watchers.on_view_type_change` when leaving bird-eye to return the focal length to its authored value.
- `focalLength` (not FOV) keeps the world-to-NDC pipeline aligned, so the route overlay stays in sync with the zoomed stream.
- Soft min / max clamps prevent a rogue pinch spinning into tunnel vision.

