## Tuning constants

| File | Constant | Value | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `bird_eye_pin_service/constants.py` | `MAX_MAGNET_SNAP_XZ_CM` | 2500.0 | Max horizontal distance from click to nearest waypoint/spawn for in-arena pin (25 m) |
| `route_composer/composer.py` | `NAVMESH_TOLERANCE_CM` | 50.0 | Mirror for the composer's "is this position on a NavMesh?" check |
| `route_composer/composer.py` | `OSM_SEGMENT_SPEED` | 5.0 | Per-segment speed boost for OSM crossings |
| `route_composer/composer.py` | `NAVMESH_SEGMENT_SPEED` | 1.0 | Base speed multiplier for NavMesh segments |
| `route_composer/composer.py` | `DEFAULT_WALK_SPEED_M_PER_S` | 1.3 | Baseline walking speed used for the ETA estimate |
| `route_composer/composer.py` | `DEFAULT_ISLAND` | `"scandinavium"` | Legacy fallback when an entrance waypoint has no island prefix |
| `view_switcher.py` | `STREAM_SETTLE_FRAMES` | 4 | Kit ticks awaited after FP entry before lifting the black overlay (NVST encode/decode buffer) |

